<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fell sharply last week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fell sharply last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude loadings from Britan's Sullom Voe terminal fell sharply to 270,105 tonnes in the week to February 18 compared to 805,889 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>The oil was equally divided between refineries in Britain</p>
<p>and northwest Europe, it said.</p>
